('127.224.d.16.B',4,'Which action shows professional protocol after a job interview?','["Send a thank-you note", "Send nothing", "Post complaints online", "Argue about the decision"]'::jsonb,0,'A thank-you note is a polite follow-up.','original'),
('127.224.d.16.C',3,'For a professional animation studio interview, the best choice of clothing is:','["costumes", "neat and appropriate attire", "pajamas", "wrinkled clothes"]'::jsonb,1,'Appropriate attire shows respect and readiness.','original'),
('127.224.d.16.C',4,'Good grooming for an interview includes:','["wearing dirty shoes", "ignoring hygiene", "being clean and tidy", "wearing heavy fragrance"]'::jsonb,2,'Grooming contributes to a professional image.','original'),
('127.224.d.17.A',3,'During an interview, looking at the speaker and nodding shows good:','["impatience", "distraction", "boredom", "nonverbal and listening skills"]'::jsonb,3,'Body language shows engagement.','original'),
('127.224.d.17.A',4,'Which behavior signals poor listening in an interview?','["Interrupting the interviewer", "Making eye contact", "Taking brief notes", "Asking a follow-up question"]'::jsonb,0,'Interrupting shows you are not listening.','original'),
('127.224.d.17.B',3,'A candidate describes software she knows and projects she finished. She is conveying her:','["music taste", "skill set", "shopping list", "travel plans"]'::jsonb,1,'Clear communication explains your abilities.','original'),
('127.224.d.17.B',4,'Which answer best communicates a skill to an interviewer?','["I guess I can try.", "Whatever you need.", "I created a two-minute animated short in Blender.", "I''m okay at stuff."]'::jsonb,2,'Specific examples show proof of skill.','original'),
