('127.224.d.17.D',4,'Which approach helps when communicating with a diverse group during an interview?','["Use stereotypes", "Use slang no one knows", "Avoid assumptions and use clear, inclusive language", "Speak only to the youngest person"]'::jsonb,2,'Inclusive language helps everyone understand.','original'),
