('127.225.d.3',4,'A student sees a spilled drink near a power strip on a set. What is the best safety response?','["Clean it up and move the power strip away from liquids", "Place a cable on it", "Step over it", "Leave it for later"]'::jsonb,0,'Liquids and electricity are a dangerous combination.','original'),
('127.225.d.1.A',3,'A practicum student explains a scene change to the crew using clear words and steady eye contact. This demonstrates:','["silent work", "verbal and non-verbal communication", "avoidance", "guesswork"]'::jsonb,1,'Communication includes both words and body language.','original'),
