('127.225.d.1.C',3,'A practicum student demonstrates her work to the class with slides and answers questions. This is a:','["private rehearsal only", "formal presentation", "sound test", "locker check"]'::jsonb,1,'Planned presentations include visuals and Q&A.','original'),
