('127.225.d.1.D',4,'A student notices a coworker looks confused during an explanation. The best response is to:','["pause and ask if anything needs clarifying", "walk away", "raise your voice", "speed up"]'::jsonb,0,'Reading cues helps improve communication.','original'),
