('127.226.d.9.B',3,'A graduate has two job offers with different pay and benefits. She should:','["choose by coin flip", "accept without reading", "ignore the details", "compare pay, benefits, and growth chances"]'::jsonb,3,'Comparing helps make a good decision.','original'),
('127.226.d.9.B',4,'Which factor is important when evaluating a job in radio or video?','["Opportunities to learn and advance", "Weather", "Lobby color", "Brand of coffee"]'::jsonb,0,'Advancement affects a long career.','original'),
